	"changenote"       "v0.39.14 — FIX: co-op active-skill player/input mapping. The mod read CoopService.connected_players[i][1] as the player slot, but that field is the controller TYPE (keyboard/Xbox/PlayStation/Switch) — the slot is the entry's index. Result: inputs were cross-mapped between players, and with two same-brand pads (or Steam Remote Play Together) one player got no skill at all. Places are now derived from the player index, so keyboard+controller, two controllers and Remote Play Together all route each player to their own skill. Thanks to ReJlax for the report and the diagnosis."
}
